purpose: Which revision of the standard do project commands run at?

Records that check, sync, verify, docs, review and vcs hand execution to the project's lock revision, with four exempt commands and fallbacks for equal revisions, the system repository and ENGSYS_USE_CHECKOUT.
Translated from Korean to English; frontmatter, command names, `resolve_locked_plugin`, `ENGSYS_USE_CHECKOUT`, `unknown command` and the ADR 0007/0008 links are unchanged.
"실행기" rendered as "entry point" to avoid confusion with the `engsys claude` launcher; 넘긴다 rendered as "hand execution over".
Headings mapped to Decision, Background and Constraints, Rationale and Alternatives, Consequences.
No Korean literals retained; no facts updated.

